{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-squeezy-dinosaur-toy-2608-0086","content_id":"e87f94bc-ef1a-4f70-a15f-360638fd2c25","description":"Product Recall for Squeezy Dinosaur Toy presenting a risk of choking. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"2d0e1faa-a47e-4282-9e0c-138d9379d80f","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-14T10:43:51+01:00","id":"2d0e1faa-a47e-4282-9e0c-138d9379d80f","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-14T10:43:51+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7ee3573be22055c1aaa322/2608-0086_-product-recall-squeezy-dinosaur.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Squeezy Dinosaur Toy</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of choking because the tail detached with minimal force, creating small parts which fit entirely within a small parts cylinder.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The local authority is requiring the recall of the product from end users by Samsons Cash and Carry Ltd.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Sensory Toys</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Code</td>\n      <td>LTY3030011 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Importer</td>\n      <td>Lyon Imports Ltd</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Squishy purple and pink toy dinosaur containing multi-coloured balls.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_2d0e1faa-a47e-4282-9e0c-138d9379d80f\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a7ee3573be22055c1aaa322/2608-0086_-product-recall-squeezy-dinosaur.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of choking because the tail detached with minimal force, creating small parts which fit entirely within a small parts cylinder. These small parts pose a choking risk to young children, particularly those under 36 months of age who have a natural tendency to explore objects by placing them in the mouth. </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The local authority is requiring the recall of the product from end users by Samsons Cash and Carry Ltd. </p>\n\n<p>Owners are advised to stop using the product and keep it out of reach of children. For more information, please contact <a href=\"mailto:samsonscashandcarry@hotmail.co.uk\">samsonscashandcarry@hotmail.co.uk</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2608-0086</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-14T09:44:39Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-14","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-14T10:44:39+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-squeezy-dinosaur-toy-2608-0086","api_url":"https://www.go